{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">'Zemke's Wolfpack', the 56th Fighter Group was one of the most famous fighting units of the USAAF in World War II. Flying the P-47 Thunderbolt throughout their time stationed in England, the Group had more ace pilots and destroyed more enemy aircraft in air combat than any other.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">After the success of the original Wolfpack campaign, Reflected Simulations set out to reconstruct 12 further missions flown by the 56thFighter Group between D-Day and July 1944, picking up the storyline right where the first one ended. With the help of an extensive archive of original combat reports, you\u2019ll be able to relive these events in DCS World exactly the way they happened 80 years ago.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Step inside this time machine to be transported back to 1944. First as a flight lead, then later as Squadron CO you\u2019ll be able to experience first hand what it was like to fly with the legendary Wolfpack as part of the \u2018Mighty Endeavor\u2019, the greatest military operation in history.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">12 historical missions based on original combat reports, and extensive research</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Several cut-scenes to increase immersion</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Nearly a thousand specially recorded voice-over messages</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Original radio broadcasts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Historically accurate custom skins</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Detailed campaign documentation and history</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Period correct briefings and briefing images, including separate PDF mission files</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unique kneeboard cards and checklists</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Encounter reports and other immersive details</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Localization:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Voiceovers: English</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Briefings/Subtitles: English</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3795640?t=1750344801","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3795640?t=1750344801","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795640/b4736a4c9dc4e562d77e43312a43326e3bc63997/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1750344801","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795640/b4736a4c9dc4e562d77e43312a43326e3bc63997/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1750344801","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Downloadable Content","id":21},{"description":"Tracked Controller Support","id":52},{"description":"Captions available","id":13},{"description":"VR Support","id":31},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Touch Only Option","id":77},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Includes level editor","id":17}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">'Zemke's Wolfpack', the 56th Fighter Group was one of the most famous fighting units of the USAAF in World War II. Flying the P-47 Thunderbolt throughout their time stationed in England, the Group had more ace pilots and destroyed more enemy aircraft in air combat than any other.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">After the success of the origina